[{"y": 0.06449127917436306, "w": 0.06082289801703558, "h": 0.0265552322098494, "x": 0.09660107365695625, "text": "6.7"}, {"x": 0.21101486377423145, "text": "WRITING", "y": 0.03890301576529374, "w": 0.13610980563693575, "h": 0.01829861976609765}, {"h": 0.012681869944080102, "x": 0.2093023328026441, "y": 0.0784011628411594, "text": "A description of an event", "w": 0.1860464986165365}, {"y": 0.14289244202179643, "x": 0.08228980796117775, "w": 0.35420393202039935, "h": 0.011399074297949709, "text": "1 Complete the short stories with the words and"}, {"x": 0.10375671566824754, "h": 0.011536027412552254, "text": "phrases from the box. There are two extra words or", "y": 0.15664711196626907, "w": 0.3703040907118056}, {"x": 0.10375670945923168, "w": 0.16457960340711805, "h": 0.01145385561867313, "text": "phrases for each story.", "y": 0.1707122094236133}, {"w": 0.2522361246744792, "x": 0.12164580590962967, "text": "after finally first the end then", "y": 0.19590703974374435, "h": 0.011476680888165624}, {"y": 0.2249593860442166, "x": 0.11091234252612313, "w": 0.34525939941406253, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "Steve started sailing when he was ten. At first, he"}, {"h": 0.012745781297718117, "y": 0.23773255824268563, "w": 0.2558139546712239, "text": "only sailed in the summer holidays.", "x": 0.11270125461877083}, {"h": 0.008851743820341951, "text": "a few", "y": 0.23899709331148608, "w": 0.04114490085177952, "x": 0.4329159209813852}, {"x": 0.10912343262336985, "text": "years, he joined a club and sailed in the winter as", "h": 0.012718390075738675, "w": 0.3434704928927952, "y": 0.2528339351812124}, {"text": "well. He became a very good sailor. In ?", "y": 0.2641941423744496, "h": 0.01706501060444529, "x": 0.1089686101575982, "w": 0.2705765787760417}, {"x": 0.4400715561457113, "y": 0.2668168608898923, "w": 0.030411449008517777, "h": 0.01153602703814043, "text": ", he"}, {"text": "decided to sail around the world and, right now, he", "x": 0.10912344133257584, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "y": 0.27946220938912664, "w": 0.35778174506293403}, {"x": 0.10912344801688505, "text": "is somewhere in the Atlantic Ocean near Argentina.", "w": 0.3667262776692708, "y": 0.293271660664127, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"h": 0.012690999602582971, "x": 0.11985688761850358, "text": "after at in suddenly that", "y": 0.3211462092277692, "w": 0.21824686686197917}, {"x": 0.1109123438552848, "w": 0.35599283854166663, "text": "Melanie's parents were worried about her. She didn't", "y": 0.3501985558709424, "h": 0.012722955653813801}, {"x": 0.11083008804557712, "h": 0.013423843401003421, "y": 0.36253226419648993, "w": 0.1164435831705729, "text": "do any exercise. 3"}, {"y": 0.364186046598429, "x": 0.2880143159156928, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.1842575920952691, "text": "first, they took her for cycle"}, {"x": 0.11091234854292048, "y": 0.37807310484987133, "text": "rides or walks but she was never happy and, one day,", "w": 0.35241502549913195, "h": 0.01266817395867856}, {"y": 0.3906362818244831, "x": 0.10912343759280349, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.16457960340711805, "text": "she just said 'no'. After 4"}, {"text": "_, they decided to", "w": 0.11985688103569875, "x": 0.32558139967893057, "y": 0.3918140793543868, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"text": "wait for her to change. It took a long time but, 5_", "x": 0.11091234622938351, "h": 0.012681869195256459, "y": 0.4046511629254619, "w": 0.3202146742078993}, {"y": 0.41968862849138255, "x": 0.10912343988929371, "text": "the end, she met a boy who loved kayaking. Soon", "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.32737030029296876}, {"y": 0.43373546532691526, "w": 0.3613595581054687, "text": "Melanie loved it too and now she goes every Saturday.", "x": 0.1091234445966394, "h": 0.012649913892849272}, {"text": "2 Choose the correct option.", "y": 0.4627583877860156, "w": 0.21673497517903645, "h": 0.01174909096762595, "x": 0.07857179527503712}, {"y": 0.4880009022687481, "h": 0.017813051030954288, "text": "I'm now a football fan!", "w": 0.2665473937988281, "x": 0.08228980920076481}, {"text": "I wasn't very happy when my boyfriend told me that he wanted to", "x": 0.08228981667910897, "y": 0.5158754510483498, "h": 0.012700130009909388, "w": 0.3935599093967014}, {"y": 0.5284386278653993, "text": "watch every match of the World Cup. 'At / For first, I stayed away", "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.3953488159179688, "x": 0.08407871980743528}, {"text": "from the television. I went out with my friends and read a lot.", "x": 0.08228981425192702, "w": 0.3631484646267361, "y": 0.5424854653134388, "h": 0.011472116058914237}, {"x": 0.08228981829737651, "y": 0.558924418802642, "w": 0.3971377224392361, "h": 0.012700130009909388, "text": "2 After that / After a few days, I noticed that even my friends knew"}, {"w": 0.37209303114149306, "text": "a lot about the World Cup. One day we went to a café. We sat", "x": 0.08407871070065644, "y": 0.5715697676308188, "h": 0.012645348314774242}, {"h": 0.011494941328406732, "w": 0.3703040907118056, "x": 0.08407871770313143, "y": 0.5853655236160032, "text": "outside in the evening sun. Suddenly / Finally, I realised that"}, {"y": 0.5981250001718691, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "x": 0.08407872643782566, "w": 0.3685151841905382, "text": "I was alone. My friends were inside, in front of a big television"}, {"text": "screen. I had a choice - sit outside alone or be with them. So,", "w": 0.3703040907118055, "x": 0.08407872801171787, "h": 0.011499506532070037, "y": 0.6107703489300449}, {"h": 0.011435595178431925, "y": 0.6246254511191758, "text": "I joined them and watched. I really enjoyed it. *Then / After that,", "x": 0.08407872230845495, "w": 0.3846153767903645}, {"y": 0.6385901165352411, "x": 0.08228980727655552, "w": 0.3953488159179688, "h": 0.011554287852793362, "text": "I decided to watch all the matches. Finally / At first, my boyfriend"}, {"w": 0.37030409071180553, "y": 0.6524999999239106, "text": "was pleased but after / then, I noticed that he was very quiet", "x": 0.08407872017182538, "h": 0.01138537906137181}, {"y": 0.6662409747221425, "x": 0.084078712590974, "w": 0.14669052124023435, "text": "when matches were on.", "h": 0.009029783393501837}, {"w": 0.37924865722656254, "x": 0.08407870873913383, "text": "In / At the end, I realised that he preferred watching the matches", "y": 0.6827301443947937, "h": 0.010234971700592574}, {"w": 0.3953488159179687, "h": 0.011577113122285855, "x": 0.08407872194560721, "text": "alone and I preferred watching them with my friends. So, that's what", "y": 0.6954941864712878}, {"text": "we did and it wasn't a problem. We both enjoyed the World Cup.", "x": 0.08228982116168797, "y": 0.7081395353084968, "h": 0.01149494132840683, "w": 0.37030409071180553}, {"text": "3 Choose the correct option.", "y": 0.7359593025448705, "w": 0.21645796034071182, "h": 0.011549722649130057, "x": 0.07513417101479611}, {"w": 0.36135955810546877, "y": 0.7536627908853503, "h": 0.01151320176864784, "text": "1 I was happy but / because / so it was a sunny day.", "x": 0.10017890167177357}, {"w": 0.3810375637478299, "h": 0.011421899941854122, "text": "2 Don't listen to music. Concentrate on / in / with your", "y": 0.7675315883848234, "x": 0.09838998923520825}, {"x": 0.12164579732376211, "w": 0.07513416714138456, "text": "homework.", "y": 0.7814825583232183, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"h": 0.012663609129427076, "text": "3 I was very pleased / please / pleasant that Jim wrote", "x": 0.09838997776005373, "y": 0.7941279072885432, "w": 0.37745975070529514}, {"h": 0.011540592616215558, "x": 0.09838998761234048, "text": "4 It's impossible to walk twenty kilometres in / for /", "w": 0.35420393202039935, "y": 0.8219476745114402}, {"y": 0.8370216604650879, "w": 0.12343470255533853, "x": 0.11985688786961757, "h": 0.011481246466240751, "text": "through one hour."}, {"h": 0.011508636564984728, "y": 0.8510319770244438, "x": 0.09838998913623094, "text": "5 We're organising a sports day to lift / raise / spend", "w": 0.3667262776692709}, {"y": 0.05437500031013689, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "x": 0.5169946332712121, "text": "4", "w": 0.012522361543443439}, {"y": 0.05437500025617142, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "x": 0.5330948200667776, "w": 0.3738819037543403, "text": "Complete the dialogue with one word in each gap."}, {"text": "The first letters are given.", "x": 0.5402504481966883, "w": 0.18783542209201387, "h": 0.011412769160115691, "y": 0.0682848841457063}, {"text": "Bella: So, tell me about the walk you went on.", "x": 0.5420393654471573, "w": 0.30948120117187505, "h": 0.011462985651587725, "y": 0.08472383758665834}, {"w": 0.10912343343098962, "h": 0.010207581227436872, "x": 0.584973167929705, "y": 0.09736462088321775, "text": "What was it for?"}, {"h": 0.012732085312316574, "x": 0.5402504509224788, "y": 0.10992779793664029, "text": "Sarah: It was to raise money f", "w": 0.20393559773763015}, {"text": "our local hospital.", "y": 0.11110559587550772, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.11270124647352431, "x": 0.813953491320483}, {"y": 0.12641696739745664, "x": 0.542039352862975, "text": "Bella: Did people wear strange clothes?", "w": 0.2683363172743056, "h": 0.011417334738190914}, {"h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.2379248555501302, "text": "Sarah: Some people did. I didn't 2d", "x": 0.5384615455851018, "y": 0.13898014472744014}, {"h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "up", "x": 0.8461538470029493, "y": 0.14162790728688104, "w": 0.01967799504597978}, {"text": "a", "y": 0.15553779075956484, "h": 0.0075872089888644875, "x": 0.5849731666142045, "w": 0.008944543202718092}, {"w": 0.2629695807562934, "h": 0.011490376124743525, "x": 0.6654740691030697, "text": "anything. 1 just wore shorts and a T-shirt.", "y": 0.15300872118640396}, {"x": 0.5384615404761574, "y": 0.16685469321089771, "text": "Bella: How far was the walk?", "w": 0.19499104817708324, "h": 0.011444725211346617}, {"text": "Sarah: It was a thirty-kilometre walk", "w": 0.2379248555501302, "x": 0.5402504528152748, "y": 0.1808284887968691, "h": 0.011545157445466848}, {"y": 0.19347383698313095, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.18962432861328127, "text": "Bella: Wow! Did you finish?", "x": 0.5384615397005149}, {"h": 0.0127366508903917, "y": 0.2072924184577658, "x": 0.5384615409182162, "w": 0.1234347025553385, "text": "Sarah: No, it was i"}, {"y": 0.20729241869170476, "h": 0.0127366508903917, "text": "to finish the walk. The day", "x": 0.7298747795699961, "w": 0.16994632297092016}, {"x": 0.5849731771180497, "text": "started sunny and warm but there was a big storm", "h": 0.012695564431834262, "y": 0.2212936051231362, "w": 0.3184257337782118}, {"y": 0.2351669672147605, "x": 0.583184267164857, "w": 0.30769229465060766, "h": 0.012681869944080102, "text": "later on. The organisers told us to stop. I walked"}, {"text": "twenty-five kilometres.", "h": 0.011572548293034468, "x": 0.5849731658292464, "w": 0.144901614718967, "y": 0.24911337234392578}, {"w": 0.1484794277615017, "y": 0.2630232559752847, "x": 0.5384615395927136, "h": 0.011403639501613013, "text": "Bella: Was it difficult?"}, {"y": 0.276782490854164, "text": "Sarah: Yes. I was with a friend for the first twenty kilometres", "w": 0.3881931898328994, "x": 0.5366726388268418, "h": 0.012955776173285286}, {"x": 0.583184257384116, "text": "She couldn't go any farther b", "w": 0.20035778469509546, "y": 0.28957848821389043, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"y": 0.2905552494971807, "w": 0.05922629038492844, "h": 0.010691826791109098, "x": 0.8514244211556138, "text": "she had"}, {"y": 0.30465703957481943, "w": 0.33273701985677084, "text": "a hole in her shoe. She called her parents. 1 nearly", "x": 0.5831842645796647, "h": 0.011476681262577447}, {"h": 0.011558853056456667, "text": "went with them but I decided to continue. After", "x": 0.5831842591095266, "y": 0.31722021666556965, "w": 0.3202146742078994}, {"x": 0.5812501116579587, "text": "that, 15c", "w": 0.05932446373833544, "h": 0.013339560298713173, "y": 0.33096103392993503}, {"x": 0.7119856922707912, "h": 0.0114218995674423, "y": 0.3325315886327817, "w": 0.18425759209526904, "text": "on singing the songs on my"}, {"y": 0.34509476521168336, "x": 0.5813953553793676, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "MP3 player. I was glad 1 °r.", "w": 0.18246868557400175}, {"text": "to take that.", "x": 0.8336314861414819, "y": 0.3450947652545026, "w": 0.08765652974446614, "h": 0.010239536904255879}, {"y": 0.35912790706354525, "text": "Bella: So, did you enjoy the day?", "x": 0.5366726352796064, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.22540249294704862}, {"text": "Sarah: Yes, I did. I was very 'p", "y": 0.37177325555300744, "x": 0.5366726376594216, "w": 0.19856886121961803, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"h": 0.009029783393501934, "y": 0.37296931391087745, "text": "that I walked so", "x": 0.8067978569960245, "w": 0.10554561191134981}, {"y": 0.38694767459047363, "h": 0.011540592616215558, "text": "far. I want to do another long walk now, but maybe", "x": 0.5831842696278173, "w": 0.3381037394205729}, {"w": 0.23076922946506073, "x": 0.5831842605626395, "h": 0.010207581227436775, "text": "I'll check the weather forecast first!", "y": 0.4008438626616471}, {"x": 0.527728085365806, "text": "SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT", "y": 0.4274127908695435, "h": 0.01151320176864784, "w": 0.23971377902560764}, {"x": 0.5205724661722515, "h": 0.012700130009909388, "y": 0.4501744186551129, "w": 0.3935599093967014, "text": "5 Read the dialogue in Exercise 4 again. Write a post for"}, {"w": 0.35778174506293403, "x": 0.5384615394989445, "y": 0.464052346693635, "text": "the blog on behalf of Sarah, in which you describe", "h": 0.012677304366004975}, {"h": 0.01138081348329678, "w": 0.19499104817708335, "text": "the event she took part in.", "x": 0.5366726365852805, "y": 0.47799418630268303}, {"x": 0.536672631598797, "y": 0.4969622094354275, "h": 0.010276057784738096, "w": 0.08944543626573342, "text": "In your post:"}, {"y": 0.5070784880531891, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.3685151841905382, "text": "• give the reason for organising the event, the time and", "x": 0.5366726384354406}, {"x": 0.5545617183868959, "text": "location.", "y": 0.5222529070171136, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "w": 0.05903398725721576}, {"y": 0.5347202165525925, "x": 0.533094819636067, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "• describe the clothes Sarah and other participants", "w": 0.3416815524631076}, {"text": "had on.", "y": 0.548225112713263, "w": 0.05230946434868711, "h": 0.011282332683728476, "x": 0.5543461629281878}, {"y": 0.561416967816055, "h": 0.012681869195256362, "text": "• describe what happened during the event.", "w": 0.3005366685655382, "x": 0.5330948104399502}, {"text": "• describe Sarah's feelings and emotions after the event.", "h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.37567084418402774, "x": 0.5330948101799002, "y": 0.5739801442125554}, {"h": 0.011499506532070037, "w": 0.24865831163194452, "x": 0.5223613654541529, "text": "SHOW THAT YOU'VE CHECKED", "y": 0.6107703490090783}, {"w": 0.2647584872775608, "text": "Finished? Always check your writing.", "h": 0.012695564431834262, "x": 0.5223613672377848, "y": 0.6360108306304946}, {"text": "Can you tick / everything on this list?", "x": 0.5223613564407925, "h": 0.0127366508903917, "y": 0.6499709305479702, "w": 0.2683363172743056}, {"x": 0.5205724536458357, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "y": 0.6701669672306646, "w": 0.1198568810356988, "text": "In my blog post:"}, {"y": 0.6917005817071478, "x": 0.5241502654794145, "text": "• I have included the reason for organising the event.", "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.35241502549913184}, {"y": 0.7117824909676842, "w": 0.35420393202039935, "h": 0.010266927377411581, "x": 0.5241502736677967, "text": "• I have mentioned the time and location of the event."}, {"x": 0.5241502849193106, "w": 0.3416815524631077, "text": "• I have described Sara's clothes as well as other", "h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.7309011629575205}, {"w": 0.08780893961588543, "x": 0.5455409693487079, "y": 0.7433027595240337, "text": "participants'", "h": 0.014397387590649329}, {"h": 0.011467550855250933, "text": "• I have described what happened at the", "y": 0.7624277977679381, "w": 0.2915921359592014, "x": 0.5223613511319081}, {"y": 0.7749909747427726, "w": 0.31484792073567713, "h": 0.011549722649130153, "x": 0.5474060972350236, "text": "beginning, during and at the end of the event."}, {"h": 0.011572548293034373, "w": 0.30769229465060755, "text": "• I have included time expressions showing", "y": 0.7928633723070435, "x": 0.5223613712197169}, {"w": 0.16457960340711808, "h": 0.01266817395867856, "x": 0.5456171756220225, "text": "the sequence of events.", "y": 0.8055087210333832}, {"h": 0.012663609129427173, "x": 0.5223613784576735, "text": "• I have described Sarah's feelings and emotions.", "y": 0.8244584835904598, "w": 0.3452593655056424}, {"text": "• I have used contractions (e.g. I'm / aren't / that's).", "w": 0.35599283854166663, "y": 0.8447093025396014, "x": 0.5223613684155112, "h": 0.011549722649130153}, {"w": 0.36625512017144096, "x": 0.09670783353567862, "h": 0.013343799058084804, "text": "6 There was a party and we all dressed off / out / up", "y": 0.8763736260708407}, {"h": 0.011773940345368938, "text": "as famous people.", "x": 0.11728395062409915, "y": 0.8908948194030135, "w": 0.12962962680392798}, {"x": 0.09670783601546418, "w": 0.362139892578125, "y": 0.9054160126674647, "text": "7 I hope you remembered to do / make / have your", "h": 0.011773940345368938}, {"text": "homework.", "y": 0.9200581395246593, "w": 0.07613168504503037, "h": 0.008720930180332598, "x": 0.1193415658365383}, {"text": "80", "x": 0.07818930057383094, "h": 0.01162790690711002, "w": 0.0246913570827908, "y": 0.9360465117353985}, {"text": "• My text is neat and clear.", "x": 0.5226337521954236, "y": 0.8850078492924114, "w": 0.19547324286566847, "h": 0.011794476157267697}]